# SatQuery AI (SIH26167)

ISRO SIH 2026 problem: an interactive vision-language assistant for multimodal remote sensing image analysis through text queries.

- Keep work in the git repo at `SIH26167/` (not the parent folder).
- Python 3.11+ is the default stack. Add a frontend later without replacing this layout: `src/` app code, `tests/` pytest, `notebooks/` exploration only, `data/` and `models/` untracked.
- Do not commit secrets, `.env` files, API keys, or private satellite scenes.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes. Conventional Commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `ci:`, `chore:`.
- Never skip hooks (`--no-verify`) unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not invent ISRO/Bhuvan APIs, CRS, or model claims. Mark unknowns and keep disclaimers on model outputs.
